<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<xliff xmlns="urn:oasis:names:tc:xliff:document:2.0" xmlns:mda="urn:oasis:names:tc:xliff:metadata:2.0" version="2.0" srcLang="en" trgLang="sv">
  <file id="tenko-ui">
    <group id="audit-export">
      <unit id="audit_export.title">
        <notes><note category="description">Title of the audit export page and its entry in the browser tab.</note></notes>
        <segment><source>Audit export</source><target>Granskningsexport</target></segment>
      </unit>
      <unit id="audit_export.lede">
        <segment><source>Every audit record goes to each sink as syslog or into a file, with its sequence number and chain hash, so a receiver can drop duplicates and see gaps. Checkpoints with the head of the chain follow every 100 records or 5 minutes.</source><target>Varje granskningspost skickas till varje exportmål som syslog eller till en fil, med sitt sekvensnummer och sin kedjehash, så att en mottagare kan släppa dubbletter och se luckor. Kontrollpunkter med kedjans topp följer efter var 100:e post eller var 5:e minut.</target></segment>
      </unit>
      <unit id="audit_export.required.title">
        <segment><source>The profile requires an audit export</source><target>Profilen kräver granskningsexport</target></segment>
      </unit>
      <unit id="audit_export.required.body">
        <segment><source>The Hardened profile requires at least one sink that delivers (TGL-21). Add one, or repair the failing one.</source><target>Profilen Hardened kräver minst ett exportmål som levererar (TGL-21). Lägg till ett eller åtgärda det som misslyckas.</target></segment>
      </unit>
      <unit id="audit_export.sinks.heading">
        <segment><source>Sinks</source><target>Exportmål</target></segment>
      </unit>
      <unit id="audit_export.add">
        <segment><source>Add sink</source><target>Lägg till exportmål</target></segment>
      </unit>
      <unit id="audit_export.add_title">
        <segment><source>Add an audit export sink</source><target>Lägg till ett exportmål för granskningsexport</target></segment>
      </unit>
      <unit id="audit_export.edit_title">
        <segment><source>Change the audit export sink</source><target>Ändra exportmålet för granskningsexport</target></segment>
      </unit>
      <unit id="audit_export.none">
        <segment><source>No sinks. The audit log stays on this installation only.</source><target>Inga exportmål. Granskningsloggen finns bara kvar på den här installationen.</target></segment>
      </unit>
      <unit id="audit_export.col.name">
        <segment><source>Name</source><target>Namn</target></segment>
      </unit>
      <unit id="audit_export.col.target">
        <segment><source>Target</source><target>Mål</target></segment>
      </unit>
      <unit id="audit_export.col.format">
        <segment><source>Format</source><target>Format</target></segment>
      </unit>
      <unit id="audit_export.col.state">
        <segment><source>State</source><target>Status</target></segment>
      </unit>
      <unit id="audit_export.col.lag">
        <notes><note category="description">Column: how many audit records a sink still has to deliver.</note></notes>
        <segment><source>Behind</source><target>Backlog</target></segment>
      </unit>
      <unit id="audit_export.col.actions">
        <notes><note category="description">Hidden header of the column with the buttons of a row.</note></notes>
        <segment><source>Actions</source><target>Åtgärder</target></segment>
      </unit>
      <unit id="audit_export.transport.tls">
        <segment><source>Syslog over TLS</source><target>Syslog över TLS</target></segment>
      </unit>
      <unit id="audit_export.transport.tcp">
        <segment><source>Syslog over TCP</source><target>Syslog över TCP</target></segment>
      </unit>
      <unit id="audit_export.transport.udp">
        <segment><source>Syslog over UDP</source><target>Syslog över UDP</target></segment>
      </unit>
      <unit id="audit_export.transport.file">
        <segment><source>JSON lines file</source><target>JSON lines-fil</target></segment>
      </unit>
      <unit id="audit_export.transport.tls_help">
        <segment><source>RFC 5425: encrypted, the receiver's certificate is checked. The recommended choice.</source><target>RFC 5425: krypterad, mottagarens certifikat kontrolleras. Det rekommenderade valet.</target></segment>
      </unit>
      <unit id="audit_export.transport.tcp_help">
        <segment><source>RFC 6587: reliable but readable on the network.</source><target>RFC 6587: pålitlig men läsbar i nätverket.</target></segment>
      </unit>
      <unit id="audit_export.transport.udp_help">
        <segment><source>RFC 5426: records can be lost without notice.</source><target>RFC 5426: poster kan gå förlorade utan förvarning.</target></segment>
      </unit>
      <unit id="audit_export.transport.file_help">
        <segment><source>A file on every controller, rotated by size, for a log shipper.</source><target>En fil på varje controller, roteras efter storlek, för en loggskickare.</target></segment>
      </unit>
      <unit id="audit_export.format.rfc5424">
        <segment><source>RFC 5424 with the record as JSON</source><target>RFC 5424 med posten som JSON</target></segment>
      </unit>
      <unit id="audit_export.format.cef">
        <segment><source>CEF</source><target>CEF</target></segment>
      </unit>
      <unit id="audit_export.format.json">
        <segment><source>JSON with the canonical bytes</source><target>JSON med de kanoniska byten</target></segment>
      </unit>
      <unit id="audit_export.state.ok">
        <segment><source>Delivering</source><target>Levererar</target></segment>
      </unit>
      <unit id="audit_export.state.failing">
        <segment><source>Failing</source><target>Misslyckas</target></segment>
      </unit>
      <unit id="audit_export.state.idle">
        <segment><source>Waiting</source><target>Väntar</target></segment>
      </unit>
      <unit id="audit_export.state.disabled">
        <segment><source>Paused</source><target>Pausad</target></segment>
      </unit>
      <unit id="audit_export.failing_since">
        <notes><note category="description">when is a relative time such as 6 minutes ago.</note></notes>
        <segment><source>failing since {when}</source><target>misslyckas sedan {when}</target></segment>
      </unit>
      <unit id="audit_export.delivered">
        <notes><note category="description">when is a relative time such as 4 seconds ago.</note></notes>
        <segment><source>last record {when}</source><target>senaste post {when}</target></segment>
      </unit>
      <unit id="audit_export.pause">
        <segment><source>Pause</source><target>Pausa</target></segment>
      </unit>
      <unit id="audit_export.resume">
        <segment><source>Resume</source><target>Återuppta</target></segment>
      </unit>
      <unit id="audit_export.paused">
        <segment><source>Sink {name} paused</source><target>Exportmålet {name} har pausats</target></segment>
      </unit>
      <unit id="audit_export.resumed">
        <segment><source>Sink {name} resumed</source><target>Exportmålet {name} har återupptagits</target></segment>
      </unit>
      <unit id="audit_export.saved">
        <segment><source>Sink {name} saved</source><target>Exportmålet {name} har sparats</target></segment>
      </unit>
      <unit id="audit_export.removed">
        <segment><source>Sink {name} removed</source><target>Exportmålet {name} har tagits bort</target></segment>
      </unit>
      <unit id="audit_export.remove_named">
        <segment><source>Remove the sink {name}</source><target>Ta bort exportmålet {name}</target></segment>
      </unit>
      <unit id="audit_export.remove_title">
        <segment><source>Remove the sink {name}?</source><target>Ta bort exportmålet {name}?</target></segment>
      </unit>
      <unit id="audit_export.remove_body">
        <segment><source>The sink receives no more records. Records already delivered stay where they are.</source><target>Exportmålet får inga fler poster. Poster som redan levererats ligger kvar där de är.</target></segment>
      </unit>
      <unit id="audit_export.remove_last">
        <segment><source>This is the last sink, and the profile requires one: the server refuses to remove it.</source><target>Det här är det sista exportmålet och profilen kräver ett: servern vägrar ta bort det.</target></segment>
      </unit>
      <unit id="audit_export.field.name">
        <segment><source>Name</source><target>Namn</target></segment>
      </unit>
      <unit id="audit_export.field.transport">
        <segment><source>Transport</source><target>Transport</target></segment>
      </unit>
      <unit id="audit_export.field.format">
        <segment><source>Format</source><target>Format</target></segment>
      </unit>
      <unit id="audit_export.field.host">
        <segment><source>Receiver</source><target>Mottagare</target></segment>
      </unit>
      <unit id="audit_export.field.port">
        <segment><source>Port</source><target>Port</target></segment>
      </unit>
      <unit id="audit_export.field.ca_pem">
        <segment><source>Certificate authority of the receiver (PEM)</source><target>Mottagarens certifikatutfärdare (PEM)</target></segment>
      </unit>
      <unit id="audit_export.field.ca_pem_help">
        <segment><source>Leave empty to trust the certificate authorities of the controller's system.</source><target>Lämna tomt för att lita på certifikatutfärdarna i controllerns system.</target></segment>
      </unit>
      <unit id="audit_export.field.client_certificate">
        <segment><source>Present the controller's certificate to the receiver</source><target>Visa controllerns certifikat för mottagaren</target></segment>
      </unit>
      <unit id="audit_export.field.path">
        <segment><source>File</source><target>Fil</target></segment>
      </unit>
      <unit id="audit_export.field.path_help">
        <segment><source>An absolute path; the same on every controller.</source><target>En absolut sökväg; samma på varje controller.</target></segment>
      </unit>
      <unit id="audit_export.field.keep_files">
        <segment><source>Rotated files to keep</source><target>Roterade filer att behålla</target></segment>
      </unit>
      <unit id="audit_export.error.name">
        <segment><source>Enter a name.</source><target>Ange ett namn.</target></segment>
      </unit>
      <unit id="audit_export.error.host">
        <segment><source>Enter the host name or address of the receiver.</source><target>Ange mottagarens värdnamn eller adress.</target></segment>
      </unit>
      <unit id="audit_export.error.port">
        <segment><source>Enter a port from 1 to 65535.</source><target>Ange en port från 1 till 65535.</target></segment>
      </unit>
      <unit id="audit_export.error.path">
        <segment><source>Enter the path of the file.</source><target>Ange filens sökväg.</target></segment>
      </unit>
      <unit id="audit_export.udp_warning">
        <segment><source>UDP has no delivery receipt: a record lost on the way is only visible as a gap in the sequence numbers.</source><target>UDP har ingen leveranskvittens: en post som försvinner på vägen syns bara som en lucka i sekvensnumren.</target></segment>
      </unit>
      <unit id="audit_export.test">
        <segment><source>Send test record</source><target>Skicka testpost</target></segment>
      </unit>
      <unit id="audit_export.test_ok">
        <segment><source>The receiver accepted the test record.</source><target>Mottagaren tog emot testposten.</target></segment>
      </unit>
      <unit id="audit_export.test_failed">
        <segment><source>The test record was not delivered: {detail}</source><target>Testposten levererades inte: {detail}</target></segment>
      </unit>
      <unit id="audit_export.verify.heading">
        <segment><source>Check an export</source><target>Kontrollera en export</target></segment>
      </unit>
      <unit id="audit_export.verify.body">
        <segment><source>A JSON export carries the canonical bytes of every record. This command checks its chain offline:</source><target>En JSON-export innehåller de kanoniska byten för varje post. Det här kommandot kontrollerar kedjan offline:</target></segment>
      </unit>
